  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "如何！？我的饭匙蛇\n在密阿雷可是很珍稀的宝可梦哟！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 236,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "59824F55FF01FF1F62117684996D531986C7000A57285BC6963F96F753EF662F5F8873CD7A0076845B9D53EF68A654DFFF0100100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "阿～柏～～～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƾ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "963FFF5E67CFFF5EFF5EFF5E00100002011401BE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的饭匙蛇叫做饭匙宝。\n它是最棒的，对吧？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62117684996D531986C753EB505A996D53195B9D3002000A5B83662F670068D27684FF0C5BF95427FF1F00100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它是阿柏怪啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83662F963F67CF602A554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它是饭匙蛇吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83662F996D531986C75417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你说它是阿柏怪？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n那我身边的这只宝可梦呢？\n怎么看它都是只饭匙蛇吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608BF45B83662F963F67CF602AFF1F00100001BE01000A90A362118EAB8FB976848FD953EA5B9D53EF68A65462FF1F000A600E4E48770B5B8390FD662F53EA996D531986C75427300200100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你居然问它是不是饭匙蛇？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n我身边的宝可梦\n怎么看都是只饭匙蛇吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F605C45713695EE5B83662F4E0D662F996D531986C7FF1F00100001BE01000A62118EAB8FB976845B9D53EF68A6000A600E4E48770B90FD662F53EA996D531986C75427300200100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过我是个明白人。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n既然你都说到这份儿上了，\n那就把真正的饭匙蛇带来吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC76211662F4E2A660E767D4EBA300200100001BE01000A65E271364F6090FD8BF452308FD94EFD513F4E0A4E86FF0C000A90A35C31628A771F6B637684996D531986C75E2667655427FF0100100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 44
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 656,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00080000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "把真正的饭匙蛇带来吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "628A771F6B637684996D531986C75E2667655427FF0100100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你把真正的饭匙蛇带来了吗？\n那就给我看看吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60628A771F6B637684996D531986C75E2667654E865417FF1F000A90A35C317ED96211770B770B5427300200100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎么？\n就是这只宝可梦？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 756,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E4E48FF1F000A5C31662F8FD953EA5B9D53EF68A6FF1F00100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "两只不都是饭匙蛇吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n不过仔细看的话，\n体型好像有点差别。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E2453EA4E0D90FD662F996D531986C75417FF1F00100001BE01000A4E0D8FC74ED47EC6770B76848BDDFF0C000A4F53578B597D50CF670970B95DEE522B300200100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这才是饭匙蛇",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9624D662F996D531986C70000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "饭匙宝是阿柏怪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 884,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "996D53195B9D662F963F67CF602A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那只宝可梦才是真正的饭匙蛇？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n这么说我的饭匙宝\n是饭匙蛇的地区形态吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A353EA5B9D53EF68A6624D662F771F6B637684996D531986C7FF1F00100001BE01000A8FD94E488BF462117684996D53195B9D000A662F996D531986C776845730533A5F6260015417FF1F00100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不是",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 988,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D662F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "它是阿柏怪啊",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 996,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B83662F963F67CF602A554A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是这样……\n它这种宝可梦是叫阿柏怪啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F8FD9683720262026000A5B838FD979CD5B9D53EF68A6662F53EB963F67CF602A554A300200100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "都怪我对宝可梦不熟，\n居然给阿柏怪起名叫饭匙宝……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1060,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90FD602A62115BF95B9D53EF68A64E0D719FFF0C000A5C4571367ED9963F67CF602A8D77540D53EB996D53195B9D2026202600100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "阿～柏～～～<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƾ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "963FFF5E67CFFF5EFF5EFF5E00100002011401BE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但话说回来……\n事到如今再叫它阿柏宝又怪怪的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1144,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F468BDD8BF456DE676520262026000A4E8B523059824ECA518D53EB5B83963F67CF5B9D53C8602A602A7684300200100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "阿柏。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƾ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "963F67CF300200100002011401BE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "叫你饭匙宝也可以吗？\n那我今后也继续这么叫你哟！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1216,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EB4F60996D53195B9D4E5F53EF4EE55417FF1F000A90A362114ECA540E4E5F7EE77EED8FD94E4853EB4F6054DFFF0100100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "阿～柏～～～！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƾ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1276,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "963FFF5E67CFFF5EFF5EFF5EFF0100100002011401BE0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好！我要好好了解一下阿柏怪，\n给饭匙宝提供最棒的环境！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1300,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597DFF0162118981597D597D4E8689E34E004E0B963F67CF602AFF0C000A7ED9996D53195B9D63D04F9B670068D2768473AF5883FF0100100002011401BD0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
