      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "竟然给阿柏怪\n起名叫饭匙宝……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n不熟悉宝可梦，\n就会犯下这么荒唐的错误啊。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
